{
  "about": "rtc.verifyTailnetPath(pc) for getStats() reports, from src/renderer/shared/rtc.js. args[0].stats is the report as an ordered list of stats objects keyed by id (order matters: the first match wins); args[0].getStatsFails means getStats() rejects. The phone applies a stricter local rule on top (its own tun IPs only); these vectors are the desktop rule. Regenerate with node scripts/make-mobile-fixtures.js.",
